    "text": "firstalert4.com\nwebsite\nSt. Louis\n‘Everybody is scared’ Some in Hispanic community nervous about potential raids\nBy Jon Kipper,4 hours ago\nST. LOUIS, Mo. (First Alert 4) - As ICE raids ramp up in Los Angeles and as close as Omaha, there is real fear in the Hispanic communities in and around St. Louis. As far as we know, mass deportations have not happened in St. Louis yet, but we talked with a couple fearful for their community.\n4\nComments / 4\nLoading editor...",
